+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Host text box (Windows)
+ *
+ * The PS3 draws its keyboard over the game; here a small window of our own
+ * takes the text instead: the prompt, an edit box holding the initial text,
+ * OK / Cancel (Enter / Esc). It runs on its own thread, so the game keeps
+ * polling its sysutil callback, and FINISHED is posted when the user is done.
+ * While it is up cellPad ignores the keyboard and mouse (g_osk_host_window_open),
+ * or typing a name would also walk the menu. OSK_TEXT=<text> skips it and
